#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.desktop.in:5
msgid "SSH Connection Manager"
msgstr "SSH 连接管理器"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.desktop.in:6
msgid "SSH connection manager with integrated terminal, tunneling, and SFTP"
msgstr "带有集成终端、隧道和 SFTP 的 SSH 连接管理器"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Manage your servers with ease"
msgstr "轻松管理您的服务器"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid "SSH Pilot is a user-friendly SSH connection manager featuring built-in tabbed terminal, remote file management, key transfer, port forwarding and more. It's an alternative to Putty, Termius and Mobaxterm."
msgstr "SSH Pilot 是一款简单易用的 SSH 连接管理器，具有内置标签式终端、远程文件管理、密钥传输、端口转发等功能。它是 Putty、Termius 和 Mobaxterm 的优秀替代品。"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid "Manage multiple machines from a unified, clean interface"
msgstr "通过统一简洁的界面管理多台机器"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Transfer files to and from servers using the built-in file manager (SFTP and SCP)"
msgstr "使用内置文件管理器（SFTP 和 SCP）在本地与服务器之间传输文件"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid "Tuned for fast keyboard navigation with customizable shortcuts"
msgstr "专为快速键盘导航设计，具有可自定义的快捷键"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Easily generate and transfer SSH keys to servers"
msgstr "轻松生成 SSH 密钥并将其传输到服务器"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Loads existing ~/.ssh/config and works with standard SSH keys and settings"
msgstr "加载现有的 ~/.ssh/config，并与标准 SSH 密钥和设置协同工作"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Configure local, remote and dynamic port forwarding"
msgstr "配置本地、远程和动态端口转发"

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Server grouping"
msgstr "服务器分组"

